# Color usage

- **Coral `#CE6B69`** (`text-coral`): titles, headings, brand display type (`font-nickainley`).
- **Peach `#FF785E`** (`text-peach-500` / `text-peach-700`, `bg-peach-500`): attention only.
- **Brown** (`text-brown-800`, `text-brown-500`): form labels, body, helper text. Never peach on labels.
- **Green** (`bg-green-500`, `bg-green-700`): primary / complete actions.

## Peach is allowed only for

- Errors and alerts (`role="alert"`, `text-peach-700`)
- Report issue
- Sign out
- Connect printer / not-yet-set-up states
- Destructive existing-item actions (archive, remove)

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — title in peach
<h1 className="font-nickainley text-peach-500">WIS Admin</h1>

// ✅ GOOD
<h1 className="font-nickainley text-coral">WIS Admin</h1>
<p className="text-sm text-peach-700" role="alert">{error}</p>
<button className="bg-peach-500 text-white">Sign out</button>
```
